            "review_title": "Review at Nu Hoang Banh Mi",
            "review_text": "Kat\nClifton Hill, Australia13 contributions\n0\nThe best veggie Bánh Mì in town!!!!\nMar 2019 • Couples\nMe being a vegan it’s not super easy to find vegetarian Bánh Mì s. We arrived in Ho Chi Minh and i was starving . With little hope we started walking and came across this place . It was super close to the house we were staying at . And oh lord I tell u it was probably the happiest day of my life . Haha. Their vegetarian Bánh Mì is delicious!! And it’s very cheap too . The put mushrooms and i think mock meat on it and just the right amount of chilli. If u want it vegan just ask them not to put mayo on it. I can only recommend !!! Being back home I already miss their Bánh Mì.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 28, 2019",
